{"title":"가지고 싶어 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"애정 어린 눈 맞춤, 다정한 손끝, 다부진 몸까지.선배 유시완은 한새이의 모든 이상을 충족시켜준 완벽한 남자였다.하지만 시완의 취업으로 함께하는 시간이 줄고,허전함을 느끼는 새이 곁에 복학한 동기 태지호가 나타난다.구릿빛 피부에 탄탄한 근육.신경 쓰이게 만드는 은근한 눈빛.실수인 듯 애타게 하는 스킨십.\"나라면 이렇게 외롭게 하진 않을 텐데.\"그 모든 의미를 알면서도모르는 척 놀아나주고 싶은 맘이 든다.어쩌지? 둘 다 가지고 싶은데.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":101,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":95,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":95,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":105,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":97,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":110,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":104,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":103,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":112,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":112,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":106,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":116,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":111,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":106,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":105,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":116,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":123,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-